  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Rilohn_Refuge\" title=\"Rilohn Refuge\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Rilohn_Refuge_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Rilohn Refuge (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Rilohn Refuge\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Rilohn_Refuge.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rilohn Refuge.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/9/99/Rilohn_Refuge.jpg/196px-Rilohn_Refuge.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/9/99/Rilohn_Refuge.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Kourna\" title=\"Kourna\">Kourna</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Floodplain_of_Mahnkelon\" title=\"The Floodplain of Mahnkelon\">The Floodplain of Mahnkelon</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rilohn Refuge world map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/fc/Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg/196px-Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/fc/Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg/294px-Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/fc/Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg/392px-Rilohn_Refuge_world_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"822\" data-file-height=\"508\" /></a><br /><small>On the world map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Rilohn_Refuge_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rilohn Refuge inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/e/e2/Rilohn_Refuge_inside.jpg/196px-Rilohn_Refuge_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/e2/Rilohn_Refuge_inside.jpg/294px-Rilohn_Refuge_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/e2/Rilohn_Refuge_inside.jpg/392px-Rilohn_Refuge_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"750\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Rilohn Refuge</b> is on the branch of the <a href=\"/wiki/Storyline_of_Nightfall\" title=\"Storyline of Nightfall\">Nightfall storyline</a> that goes with <a href=\"/wiki/Master_of_Whispers\" title=\"Master of Whispers\">Master of Whispers</a> (based on your choice in the <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Message_(Nightfall_quest)\" title=\"Mysterious Message (Nightfall quest)\">Mysterious Message</a> quest). If you have sided with <a href=\"/wiki/Margrid_the_Sly\" title=\"Margrid the Sly\">Margrid the Sly</a> instead, this location is optional.\n</p>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>Located high above the banks of the <a href=\"/wiki/Elon\" title=\"Elon\">Elon</a> river, the Refuge is used by the nearby villagers and workers as a temporary camp. When the <a href=\"/wiki/Elon\" title=\"Elon\">Elon River</a> overflows its banks every spring to give life back to the fertile plains, the residents of the surrounding area retreat here until the floods have subsided and the land is restored once more.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Exits\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exits</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Quests_available\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests available</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Rilohn_Refuge_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">primary quest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/To_Kill_a_Demon\" title=\"To Kill a Demon\">To Kill a Demon</a> will lead characters here. This quest is along the Master of Whispers' branch of the storyline.\n</p><p>For those who went with Margrid's branch, Rilohn Refuge can be reached by traveling north from <a href=\"/wiki/Kodonur_Crossroads_(outpost)\" title=\"Kodonur Crossroads (outpost)\">Kodonur Crossroads</a> to the northern edge of the Floodplain of Mahnkelon.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exits\">Exits</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Rilohn_Refuge_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Exits\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Floodplain_of_Mahnkelon\" title=\"The Floodplain of Mahnkelon\">The Floodplain of Mahnkelon</a> (south)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests_available\">Quests available</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Rilohn_Refuge_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Quests available\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mahzu\" title=\"Mahzu\">Mahzu</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Drakes_on_the_Plain\" title=\"Drakes on the Plain\">Drakes on the Plain</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Rilohn_Refuge_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Rilohn_Refuge_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Rilohn_Refuge_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Ashnod\" title=\"Ashnod\">Ashnod</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Merchant\" title=\"Merchant\">merchant</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Agent\" title=\"Xunlai Agent\">Xunlai Agent</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage_upgrades\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage upgrades\">storage upgrades</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Chest\" title=\"Xunlai Chest\">Xunlai Chest</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage\">storage</a>)</li></ul>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Henchmen\">Henchmen</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Rilohn_Refuge_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Henchmen\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h5>\n<dl><dd><i>(all level 20)</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Devona\" title=\"Devona\">Devona</a> (Fighter)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Aidan\" title=\"Aidan\">Aidan</a> (Archer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Kihm\" title=\"Kihm\">Kihm</a> (Healer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Mhenlo\" title=\"Mhenlo\">Mhenlo</a> (Healer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Eve\" title=\"Eve\">Eve</a> (Blood)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Odurra\" title=\"Odurra\">Odurra</a> (Illusion)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Cynn\" title=\"Cynn\">Cynn</a> (Fire)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Herta\" title=\"Herta\">Herta</a> (Earth)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sogolon\" title=\"Sogolon\">Sogolon</a> (Motivation)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Dervish\"><img alt=\"Dervish\" src=\"/images/3/3e/Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Gehraz\" title=\"Gehraz\">Gehraz</a> (Holy)</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_allies\">Other allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Rilohn_Refuge_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Other allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Dervish\"><img alt=\"Dervish\" src=\"/images/3/3e/Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Dehjah\" title=\"Dehjah\">Dehjah</a> (mission starter)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Mahzu\" title=\"Mahzu\">Mahzu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Motur\" title=\"Motur\">Motur</a> (mission briefing)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Kournan_Noble\" title=\"Kournan Noble\">Kournan Nobles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Kournan_Peasant\" title=\"Kournan Peasant\">Kournan Peasants</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Kournan_Child\" title=\"Kournan Child\">Kournan Children</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Rilohn_Refuge_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/World_map\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"World map\">world map</a> may mark this location with the icon for an outpost upon initial arrival. It changes into the icon for a mission outpost only upon completion of the quest that precedes the <a href=\"/wiki/Rilohn_Refuge\" title=\"Rilohn Refuge\">Rilohn Refuge mission</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Pogahn_Passage\" title=\"Pogahn Passage\">Pogahn Passage mission</a>, which is <a href=\"/wiki/To_Kill_a_Demon\" title=\"To Kill a Demon\">To Kill a Demon</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/No_Me,_No_Kormir\" title=\"No Me, No Kormir\">No Me, No Kormir</a>.</li></ul>\n<table style=\"float: right; border: 1px solid #D16E5A; width: 250px; margin: 0 0 1em 1em; line-height: 1.4em; font-size: 0.9em; background: #F9F9F9;\" cellspacing=\"3\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Main_Page\" title